    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/d61d5c7276a990c2e9935fb053cf1bbb.poster.avif?t=1755106420\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/d61d5c7276a990c2e9935fb053cf1bbb.webm?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/d61d5c7276a990c2e9935fb053cf1bbb.mp4?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>ESCAPE PROTOCOL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this co-op survival horror game, you awaken inside a structure where physical reality has collapsed. Corridors leading to voids, twisted architecture, and unidentified entities drag you into a battle for sanity and survival. Communicate, solve puzzles, expose the saboteur, and find a way out of this decaying dimension.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/ca0581a37d8e0460c63fecf546fb9565.avif?t=1755106420\" width=800 height=177 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/3d82eb5d515c028c3e26558d1b64aef1.poster.avif?t=1755106420\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/3d82eb5d515c028c3e26558d1b64aef1.webm?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/3d82eb5d515c028c3e26558d1b64aef1.mp4?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The map reshapes every playthrough!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality is breaking apart, and dimensions are colliding. You and your team must survive in this twisted structure filled with traps and supernatural entities, and find a way to escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/9a48ff3b01700de76b3f47316b1d91fd.poster.avif?t=1755106420\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/9a48ff3b01700de76b3f47316b1d91fd.webm?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/9a48ff3b01700de76b3f47316b1d91fd.mp4?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Unknown Entities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown entities drawn into this realm from different dimensions and realities roam around. They respond to sounds, movements, and environmental interactions. Your mission is to survive among these dangers and remain as silent as possible. Because some things awaken only by sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/86db4f085b4da42538dcfc693d44b50c.avif?t=1755106420\" width=800 height=177 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/47ff7fa3862f14731ca77897008e4415.poster.avif?t=1755106420\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/47ff7fa3862f14731ca77897008e4415.webm?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/47ff7fa3862f14731ca77897008e4415.mp4?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Puzzles change every playthrough!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles rearranged differently each time require careful exploration and teamwork. Use your wit to navigate locked doors, trap mechanisms, and environmental clues. Every solved puzzle brings you one step closer to escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/25b5943dc2f441ac78662becc23b2658.avif?t=1755106420\" width=800 height=177 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/65e74bdf47c13c90cc55d8599d7876e2.poster.avif?t=1755106420\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/65e74bdf47c13c90cc55d8599d7876e2.webm?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/65e74bdf47c13c90cc55d8599d7876e2.mp4?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Last Soldier Standing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m developing the game solo and constantly improving it. I\u2019d be very grateful for your patience and support. Your feedback means a lot to me. Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/155b42d2c4717e9a3e79483b2f1d963a.avif?t=1755106420\" width=800 height=177 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join our Discord server</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow game updates, meet other players, and develop strategies together. Our community is valuable; your feedback plays a big role in the game's progress. Join us on Discord!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/d61d5c7276a990c2e9935fb053cf1bbb.poster.avif?t=1755106420\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/d61d5c7276a990c2e9935fb053cf1bbb.webm?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/d61d5c7276a990c2e9935fb053cf1bbb.mp4?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>ESCAPE PROTOCOL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this co-op survival horror game, you awaken inside a structure where physical reality has collapsed. Corridors leading to voids, twisted architecture, and unidentified entities drag you into a battle for sanity and survival. Communicate, solve puzzles, expose the saboteur, and find a way out of this decaying dimension.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/ca0581a37d8e0460c63fecf546fb9565.avif?t=1755106420\" width=800 height=177 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/3d82eb5d515c028c3e26558d1b64aef1.poster.avif?t=1755106420\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/3d82eb5d515c028c3e26558d1b64aef1.webm?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/3d82eb5d515c028c3e26558d1b64aef1.mp4?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The map reshapes every playthrough!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reality is breaking apart, and dimensions are colliding. You and your team must survive in this twisted structure filled with traps and supernatural entities, and find a way to escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/9a48ff3b01700de76b3f47316b1d91fd.poster.avif?t=1755106420\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/9a48ff3b01700de76b3f47316b1d91fd.webm?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/9a48ff3b01700de76b3f47316b1d91fd.mp4?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Unknown Entities</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unknown entities drawn into this realm from different dimensions and realities roam around. They respond to sounds, movements, and environmental interactions. Your mission is to survive among these dangers and remain as silent as possible. Because some things awaken only by sound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/86db4f085b4da42538dcfc693d44b50c.avif?t=1755106420\" width=800 height=177 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/47ff7fa3862f14731ca77897008e4415.poster.avif?t=1755106420\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/47ff7fa3862f14731ca77897008e4415.webm?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/47ff7fa3862f14731ca77897008e4415.mp4?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Puzzles change every playthrough!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles rearranged differently each time require careful exploration and teamwork. Use your wit to navigate locked doors, trap mechanisms, and environmental clues. Every solved puzzle brings you one step closer to escape.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/25b5943dc2f441ac78662becc23b2658.avif?t=1755106420\" width=800 height=177 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/65e74bdf47c13c90cc55d8599d7876e2.poster.avif?t=1755106420\" width=800 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/65e74bdf47c13c90cc55d8599d7876e2.webm?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/65e74bdf47c13c90cc55d8599d7876e2.mp4?t=1755106420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Last Soldier Standing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m developing the game solo and constantly improving it. I\u2019d be very grateful for your patience and support. Your feedback means a lot to me. Thank you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3655040/extras/155b42d2c4717e9a3e79483b2f1d963a.avif?t=1755106420\" width=800 height=177 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Join our Discord server</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow game updates, meet other players, and develop strategies together. Our community is valuable; your feedback plays a big role in the game's progress. Join us on Discord!</p>",
